    sections: [
      {
        type: 'about',
        tabLabel: 'About',
        pages: [
          {
            title: 'Truf',
            subtitle: 'Card Game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Truf is an Indonesian trick-taking game for 4 players. Unique bidding: each player simultaneously places a card face-down â€” the rank indicates how many tricks they bid (court cards = 0, A = 1, numbers = face value). Highest bidder's card suit becomes trump. Trump cards are played face down and revealed later. Exact bid = points; over/under = penalty.",
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Truf is a popular Indonesian trick-taking game with bidding, classified under the Exact Bidding group. The name is probably derived from the Dutch word troef (trump), reflecting historical Dutch influence in Indonesia. Players bid by placing a card from hand face down to propose trump suit and number of tricks; trumps are played face down and revealed only after each trick. The documented rules draw on information from Indonesian contributors Riza Purwo Nugroho, David Nugraha and Hamdanil Rasyid. The game is played in Indonesia and among Indonesian communities abroad (e.g. Singapore, California).',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Two or more players.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '52 cards (4 players) or 39 (3 players, remove 1 black suit). 13 each.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Cards, score sheet',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '13 cards each. Re-deal if hand is all number or all court cards.',
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
